# export the variables in your shell instead. Never commit the real token.
#
# Cloudflare API token with the minimum permissions listed in docs/deployment-cloudflare.md:
#   Account · Cloudflare Pages · Edit
#   Zone    · Zone · Read
#   Zone    · DNS · Edit
#   Zone    · Zone Settings · Edit   (optional; only if manage_always_use_https = true)
